### Preserve readable text fallback for Rich Text paste (3/3)

**Severity:** `medium`

Read the source text before converting it to HTML, then pass both representations into the package helper.

```suggestion
        var plainText = await clipboardData.GetTextOrEmptyAsync();
        var html = await RichTextHelper.ToRichTextAsync(clipboardData);
        return DataPackageHelpers.CreateFromHtml(html, plainText);
```
